---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const tree = [
  { prefix: "├─", label: "01_environment/", href: "#", active: false },
  { prefix: "│  ├─", label: "shell", href: "#shell", active: true },
  { prefix: "│  └─", label: "packages", href: "#packages", active: false },
  { prefix: "├─", label: "02_recon/", href: "#", active: false },
  { prefix: "└─", label: "03_privilege-escalation/", href: "#", active: false },
];

const inline =
  "rounded-sm border border-line-soft bg-panel px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.8em] text-ink";
---

<Layout
  title="wiki"
  description="A personal wiki: shell setup, recon notes and privilege escalation cheatsheets."
>
  <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[15rem_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-10">
    <aside class="lg:sticky lg:top-[calc(var(--header-h)+1.5rem)] lg:self-start">
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <span>[ contents ]</span>
          <span>03</span>
        </div>

        <nav aria-label="Wiki contents" class="p-3">
          <ul class="space-y-1 font-mono text-xs">
            {
              tree.map((item) => (
                <li>
                  <a
                    href={item.href}
                    class:list={[
                      "flex gap-2 py-0.5 transition-colors",
                      item.active ? "text-accent" : "text-muted hover:text-ink",
                    ]}
                    aria-current={item.active ? "page" : undefined}
                  >
                    <span class="whitespace-pre text-[#3a3a3a]" aria-hidden="true">
                      {item.prefix}
                    </span>
                    <span>{item.label}</span>
                  </a>
                </li>
              ))
            }
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </div>

      <div class="panel mt-3">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <span>git log -1</span>
        </div>
        <div class="px-3 py-2.5 font-mono text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
          <p class="text-muted">a3f9c21 docs: shell + packages</p>
          <p class="text-dim">2026-11-18 · atlas</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <article class="min-w-0">
      <nav class="font-mono text-[11px] text-dim" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        ~/wiki/environment
      </nav>

      <h1
        class="mt-2 font-mono text-[clamp(1.6rem,3.6vw,2.25rem)] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink"
      >
        Environment setup
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-[11px] text-dim">
        2026-11-18 · 2 min read · <span class="text-muted">#basics</span>
      </p>

      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.8] text-ink/85">
        Every machine I rebuild starts here: a shell that behaves, a package list
        I can replay, and notes short enough to actually read. This is the page I
        open before I open anything else.
      </p>

      <h2
        id="shell"
        class="mt-10 flex items-baseline gap-2 scroll-mt-28 font-mono text-lg font-medium text-ink"
      >
        <span class="text-dim" aria-hidden="true">##</span> Shell
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.8] text-ink/85">
        zsh with a minimal prompt, tmux for anything long-running, and
        <span class={inline}>fzf</span> bound to history search. Nothing that needs
        a plugin manager to survive an update.
      </p>

      <div class="code mt-4">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <span>bash — ./setup.sh</span>
          <span>utf-8</span>
        </div>
        <pre><code><span class="tok-comment"># default shell + the essentials</span>
<span class="prompt">$</span> sudo apt install <span class="tok-flag">-y</span> zsh tmux fzf ripgrep
<span class="prompt">$</span> chsh <span class="tok-flag">-s</span> <span class="tok-str">"$(which zsh)"</span>
<span class="prompt">$</span> exec zsh</code></pre>
      </div>

      <h2
        id="packages"
        class="mt-10 flex items-baseline gap-2 scroll-mt-28 font-mono text-lg font-medium text-ink"
      >
        <span class="text-dim" aria-hidden="true">##</span> Packages
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-[0.9375rem] leading-[1.8] text-ink/85">
        Installed from a single list so a rebuild takes minutes, not an evening.
        The list lives in the repo; this page only explains why each entry is
        there.
      </p>

      <div class="note mt-4">
        <span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">&gt;</span>
        <p>
          <strong class="font-mono text-[0.78rem] text-ink">note:</strong>{" "}
          keep the package list in version control — a wiki you cannot replay is
          just a diary.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 border-t border-line-soft pt-4 font-mono text-[11px] text-dim"
      >
        <span>last modified 2026-11-18</span>
        <span class="text-[#3a3a3a]" aria-hidden="true">|</span>
        <span>tags: <span class="text-muted">#basics</span></span>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>